---
layout: layouts/base.njk
---
<article class="rambling">
  <header class="mb-8">
    <a href="/ramblings/" class="inline-block mb-3 text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider text-gray-500 hover:text-gray-800 hover:underline">碎碎念</a>
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold leading-tight mb-2">{{ title }}</h1>
    <div class="text-sm text-gray-500">
      <time datetime="{{ date | isoDate }}">{{ date | readableDate }}</time>
      {% if updated %}
        &middot; Updated: <time datetime="{{ updated | isoDate }}">{{ updated | readableDate }}</time>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </header>

  <aside class="my-6 p-4 border-l-4 border-gray-300 bg-gray-50 text-gray-700 text-sm">
    你看到的是一篇碎碎念，都是随手记下，所以可能不完整，但也可能会在未来整理重写。
    大多数情况下这就是终点了，谁知道呢？
  </aside>

  <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
    {{ content | safe }}
  </div>

  {% if supersededBy %}
    <aside class="mt-10 p-4 border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50 text-sm">
      这些笔记后来整理成了正式文章：<a href="{{ supersededBy }}" class="underline">{{ supersededBy }}</a>。
    </aside>
  {% endif %}

  {% if comments != false %}
    <hr class="my-12">

    <section class="giscus-comments" aria-label="评论">
      <script src="https://giscus.app/client.js"
        data-repo="homeofnever/blog"
        data-repo-id="MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnkxNTI2NjcxNzQ="
        data-category="Comments"
        data-category-id="DIC_kwDOCRmEJs4C51bD"
        data-mapping="pathname"
        data-strict="0"
        data-reactions-enabled="1"
        data-emit-metadata="0"
        data-input-position="top"
        data-theme="light"
        data-lang="zh-CN"
        crossorigin="anonymous"
        async>
      </script>
    </section>
  {% endif %}
</article>
